=== G Social Share Plugin ===
Contributors: gdeflo
Donate link: http://www.plrpackagestore.com/
Tags: share, social share, viral traffic, share button
Requires at least: 2.0.2
Tested up to: 3.3.1
Stable tag: 4.3

Social Sharing was never so easy. Increase your web traffic by inserting a social share button in your posts or pages or sidebar wherever you wish with the help of a small one word short code.

== Description ==

Simple as it may seem but this plugin is pretty useful in increasing your blog traffic. Have you heard about viral traffic? Just place these buttons wherever you think your blog readers are most engaged with your content & increase your traffic virally in no time. Use it to believe it.

For any help, visit www.i5ws.com/johnthedeveloper

== Installation ==

Installing G Social Share Wordpress plugin is very easy. Just copy the "g-social-share" folder & paste it into your wp-content/plugins folder.
For detailed instruction on how to install manually, visit http://codex.wordpress.org/Managing_Plugins#Manual_Plugin_Installation

After installing the plugin, the next thing you need to do is activate the plugin by logging in to your Wordpress blog admin panel & clicking on installed plugins 
sub menu link. Once you activate this plugin, you will find a new tab. Just click on that tab & follow the instructions there to use the plugin.

For any help, contact www.i5ws.com/johnthedeveloper

== Frequently Asked Questions ==

Q.What this plugin is all about?

This plugin help you increase your blog traffic by allowing you to add stunning & beautiful social share buttons to your WP posts OR pages OR sidebar.

